@startuml agentic-service-capability-boundary
title Agentic Service vs Agentic Capability Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Agentic Service" as asvc
class "Agentic Capability" as acap

asvc <-- acap : delivered-through (where canonical)

note right of asvc
  Service-level delivery
  or interaction involving
  agentic behavior
end note

note right of acap
  Enduring ability to achieve
  or enable an Outcome
  through agentic realization
end note

note bottom
  Distinct semantic kinds
  per ADR-ES-014 §7
  per ASVC-NEG-002
end note
@enduml
